{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51743","headline":"嘲道门进《武成混元图》 · 光业","name":"嘲道门进《武成混元图》","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜深灯火满坛舖，拔剑挥空乱叫呼。\n黑撒半筐兵甲豆，朱书一道厌人符。\n重臣餧饲刚教活，圣主慈悲未忍诛。\n佛说毘卢三界了（一作「乃三界」），如何更有《混元图》。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"光业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}